- **Windows**: `%APPDATA%\Cursor\User\mcp.json`
- **Linux**: `~/.config/Cursor/User/mcp.json`

### Claude Desktop

- **macOS**: `~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json`
