Using uv for better isolation:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "tooluniverse": {
      "command": "uv",
      "args": [
        "--directory",
        "/absolute/path/to/tooluniverse-env",
        "run",
        "tooluniverse-smcp-stdio",
        "--compact-mode"
      ],
      "env": {
        "PYTHONIOENCODING": "utf-8"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

